Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Stained Light Blisters the Overpass
- Story & Context: On a freezing November dawn above the Ulsan Container Terminal, Park clipped a pair of rusted jumper leads into Highway Box 14-B and pumped thirty seconds of pure accordion drone across four lanes of gridlocked freight trucks. The biting sea air carried the reek of chemical runoff when tactical police cruisers slammed their bumpers into the band’s flatbed truck, triggering a chaotic ten-minute brawl punctuated by Vance ripping pentatonic slide licks over the blaring megaphone. As the windshield of the police cruiser fractured under a thrown wrench, Park screamed the opening rallying cry through the spliced municipal siren horns: "You built this concrete cage, now taste the splintered teeth!"
